   "properties": {
    "markdown": "## react-learn RAG 챗봇 모니터링\nCloudFront `E1W2R37PLAMJ4T` (/api/*) → API Gateway `react-learn-api` (maxu6ee1q7, 스로틀 2 rps / burst 5) → Lambda `react-learn-api` → Bedrock KB `react-learn-kb` (CQDAFOUMG8, S3 Vectors) + Claude Haiku 4.5 · 로그 `/aws/lambda/react-learn-api` · ap-northeast-2"
   }
  },
  {
